              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/client/transport/MoqTransportAdapter.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "endLine": 483,
                  "startLine": 361
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Room creation and joining disclose a relay-wide publish/subscribe bearer\n\nThe public create route and open join route return the same configured MOQ_RELAY_TOKEN to browsers. The adapter then authenticates relay operations with that bearer without room, participant, track, action or expiry claims.\n\nSeverity: high\n\nCategory: Broken access control\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-522\n\nRemediation:\nReplace the shared browser-visible token with short-lived credentials scoped to one opaque room and participant, authorising only the participant's publication track and server-approved subscriptions. If the relay cannot enforce that scope, keep live transport unavailable or add an enforcing relay boundary, then rotate the shared secret.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Verify create and join return distinct short-lived credentials.\n- Attempt publication outside the participant's own namespace and assert relay denial.\n- Toggle routing consent and assert a revoked subscription is rejected at the relay.\n\nPreventive controls:\n- Automated check forbidding Worker secret passthrough into API responses.\n- Credential claims and expiry audit logging without token values.\n- Live relay acceptance tests for namespace ownership and revocation."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:44c315ef0cf9393c45af51058562e5fc6aa4eeacf46f9907bc8861f71ebf9899"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "broken-access-control",
            "confidence": "medium",
            "findingId": "csf_2a93aec13acf3bde269a810c",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_42faffe2e4ceda7217fb6d37",
            "severity": "high"
          },
          "ruleId": "access-control.relay-wide-browser-bearer",
          "ruleIndex": 0
        },
